-- The stanzas allowed to mention the ownership transactions' issuer bridge
-- (owner-tx-issuer, Hetoimasia.Foundation.OwnerTx.Issuer or
-- Hetoimasia.Foundation.OwnerTx.Representation) in any .cabal or cabal.project*
-- file, in Cabal's field syntax. tools/owner-tx-guard (the test.owner-tx-guard
-- group) refuses a protected text anywhere else, and a stale, duplicate or
-- malformed entry. What a listed stanza's component imports, exports and
-- instantiates is checked by issuer review; see
-- docs/validation.md#the-issuer-bridges-import-guard.

entry
  file: packages/foundation/hetoimasia-foundation.cabal
  stanza: library owner-tx-issuer
  reason: the issuer bridge's definition

entry
  file: packages/foundation/hetoimasia-foundation.cabal
  stanza: library internal
  reason: the private library holding the bridge-equivalent representation

entry
  file: packages/foundation/hetoimasia-foundation.cabal
  stanza: test-suite foundation-tests
  reason: its composition example builds through the bridge
